WEBVTT

00:01:29.958 --> 00:01:32.851
who deters crime by his strong,
masculine appearance.

00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:34.143
This is a real --

00:01:34.167 --> 00:01:35.184
(Laughter)

00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:36.809
This is a real thing, by the way.

00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:37.851
(Laughter)

00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:41.601
But my eyes were set
on the Sima Video Ed/it 2.

00:01:41.625 --> 00:01:44.476
This thing was so cool at the age of 10.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.309
You could connect
all your VHS players together

00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:48.684
and cut something together,

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.601
so I called my parents
and convinced them to buy this for me.

00:01:51.625 --> 00:01:52.976
But before I get into that,

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.351
let me give you a little rundown
about my parents.

00:01:55.375 --> 00:01:57.976
They came to the United States
when they were young,

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.684
they're from Taiwan and China

00:01:59.708 --> 00:02:02.601
and they settled
in Los Altos, California --